		<link rel="icon" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/favicon.ico`} />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Administering Intramuscular Injections</title>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-base-200 min-h-screen">
		<main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl p-6 lg:p-10">
			<div class="breadcrumbs text-sm mb-6">
				<ul>
					<li><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>Home</a></li>
					<li><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/skills`}>Skills</a></li>
					<li>Administering Intramuscular Injections</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<section class="hero bg-base-100 rounded-box shadow-xl">
				<div class="hero-content w-full flex-col items-start gap-4">
					<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Administering Intramuscular Injections</h1>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<a href="https://connect.elsevierperformancemanager.com/#/content/skills/13712/videos" class="btn btn-primary resource-link">
							Watch Video
						</a>
						<a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/skills/checklists/Administering Intramuscular Injections - Checklist.pdf`} class="btn btn-outline resource-link">
							Checklist (PDF)
						</a>
						<a href="https://lrps.wgu.edu/provision/340291574" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary resource-link">
							Open LRPS
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl mt-6 overflow-hidden">
				<div class="card-body p-0">
					<div role="tablist" class="tabs tabs-border tabs-lg w-full px-4 pt-2">

						<!-- Tab 1: Overview -->
						<input type="radio" name="page_tabs" role="tab" class="tab font-semibold" aria-label="Overview" checked />
						<div role="tabpanel" class="tab-content p-4 space-y-6">

							<div>
								<h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Summary</h2>
								<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
									<li><strong>Before the procedure</strong>
										<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 mt-1 space-y-1">
											<li>Prepare medication for one patient at a time</li>
											<li>Perform hand hygiene and use aseptic technique; avoid interruptions</li>
											<li>Check medication label against order and MAR at least twice before bedside</li>
											<li>Confirm expiration date; administer at correct scheduled time
												<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 mt-1 space-y-1">
													<li>Stat doses: immediately</li>
													<li>Now doses: within 60 minutes</li>
												</ul>
											</li>
										</ul>
									</li>
									<li><strong>At the bedside</strong>
										<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 mt-1 space-y-1">
											<li>Ensure privacy; identify patient with two identifiers; verify allergies</li>
											<li>Third check: compare medication label to MAR again</li>
											<li>Explain procedure, purpose, effects, and possible adverse reactions</li>
											<li>Obtain agreement; inform patient that mild stinging or burning may occur</li>
										</ul>
									</li>
									<li><strong>Site selection and preparation</strong>
										<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 mt-1 space-y-1">
											<li>Don clean gloves</li>
											<li>Preferred site: <strong>ventrogluteal</strong>; alternatives: vastus lateralis, deltoid</li>
											<li>Assess muscle integrity; rotate sites as needed</li>
											<li>Avoid bruised, inflamed, edematous, hardened, or tender areas</li>
											<li>Position patient comfortably; expose only the needed area</li>
										</ul>
									</li>
									<li><strong>Landmarking and cleansing (ventrogluteal)</strong>
										<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 mt-1 space-y-1">
											<li>Place heel of palm on the greater trochanter of the femur</li>
											<li>Thumb points anteriorly; middle finger points superiorly along the iliac crest</li>
											<li>Index finger on the anterior superior iliac spine — forms a V-triangle</li>
											<li>Inject into the <strong>center of the triangle</strong></li>
											<li>Clean site from center outward at least 5 cm (2 in)</li>
											<li>Optional comfort: EMLA ~1 hour before, or vapocoolant spray just before injection</li>
										</ul>
									</li>
									<li><strong>Injection technique (Z-track)</strong>
										<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 mt-1 space-y-1">
											<li>Remove cap; hold syringe like a dart</li>
											<li>Pull skin laterally 2.5–3.5 cm (1–1.5 in)</li>
											<li>Insert needle at 90° with a smooth motion; stabilize syringe</li>
											<li>Aspirate (unless giving a vaccine)
												<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 mt-1 space-y-1">
													<li>Blood present: discard; restart with new medication and syringe</li>
													<li>No blood: inject medication, wait 10 seconds</li>
												</ul>
											</li>
											<li>Withdraw smoothly; activate safety sheath; release skin</li>
											<li>Apply light pressure with gauze or alcohol swab</li>
										</ul>
									</li>
									<li><strong>After injection</strong>
										<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 mt-1 space-y-1">
											<li>Discard sharps in a puncture-proof, leak-proof container</li>
											<li>Do <strong>not</strong> massage the site</li>
											<li>Apply bandage if needed; reposition patient; remove gloves; perform hand hygiene</li>
										</ul>
									</li>
									<li><strong>Documentation and follow-up</strong>
										<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 mt-1 space-y-1">
											<li>Document immediately in MAR: medication, dose, and site</li>
											<li>Observe patient for several minutes for allergic reaction</li>
											<li>Reassess in 15–20 minutes for acute site reactions (burning, tingling, numbness, pain)</li>
										</ul>
									</li>
								</ul>
							</div>

							<div>
								<h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Injection Site Reference</h2>
								<div role="tablist" class="tabs tabs-border">
									<input type="radio" name="injection_sites" role="tab" class="tab" aria-label="Ventrogluteal ★ Preferred" checked />
									<div role="tabpanel" class="tab-content pt-4">
										<figure class="rounded-box overflow-hidden border border-base-300 bg-base-200">
											<img
												src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/skills/images/ventral-gluteal.png`}
												alt="The ventrogluteal site, the preferred site for adult intramuscular injection"
												class="w-full h-auto"
											/>
										</figure>
										<p class="text-sm opacity-80 mt-2">The ventrogluteal (ventral gluteal) site is the <strong>preferred</strong> site for adult intramuscular injections.</p>
										<figure class="rounded-box overflow-hidden border border-base-300 bg-base-200 mt-3">
											<img
												src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/skills/images/ventrogluteal-injection-landmark.png`}
												alt="Ventrogluteal landmarking diagram showing hand placement to form the injection triangle"
												class="w-full h-auto"
											/>
										</figure>
										<p class="text-sm opacity-80 mt-2"><strong>Landmarking:</strong> Place the heel of the palm on the greater trochanter of the femur. Point the thumb anteriorly (toward the patient's front) and the middle finger superiorly along the iliac crest. The index finger rests on the anterior superior iliac spine, forming a V-shaped triangle. Inject into the <strong>center of this triangle</strong>.</p>
									</div>

									<input type="radio" name="injection_sites" role="tab" class="tab" aria-label="Vastus Lateralis" />
									<div role="tabpanel" class="tab-content pt-4">
										<figure class="rounded-box overflow-hidden border border-base-300 bg-base-200">
											<img
												src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/skills/images/vastus-lateralus.png`}
												alt="The vastus lateralis muscle, an acceptable site for adult intramuscular injection"
												onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/skills/images/vastus-lateralis.svg';"
												class="w-full h-auto"
											/>
										</figure>
										<p class="text-sm opacity-80 mt-2">The vastus lateralis muscle is an acceptable alternative site for an adult intramuscular injection.</p>
									</div>

									<input type="radio" name="injection_sites" role="tab" class="tab" aria-label="Deltoid" />
									<div role="tabpanel" class="tab-content pt-4">
										<figure class="rounded-box overflow-hidden border border-base-300 bg-base-200">
											<img
												src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/skills/images/deltoid.png`}
												alt="The deltoid muscle, an acceptable site for adult intramuscular injection"
												class="w-full h-auto"
											/>
										</figure>
										<p class="text-sm opacity-80 mt-2">The deltoid muscle is an acceptable alternative site for an adult intramuscular injection.</p>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

						</div>

						<!-- Tab 2: Checklist -->
						<input type="radio" name="page_tabs" role="tab" class="tab font-semibold" aria-label="Checklist" />
						<div role="tabpanel" class="tab-content p-4">

							<p class="text-sm opacity-70 mb-3">Check off each step as you complete it. Progress resets on page refresh.</p>
							<div id="checklist-progress" class="mb-4">
								<div class="flex justify-between text-xs mb-1">
									<span id="checklist-count" class="opacity-70">0 of 43 completed</span>
									<button onclick="resetChecklist()" class="btn btn-xs btn-ghost opacity-50">Reset</button>
								</div>
								<progress id="checklist-bar" class="progress progress-success w-full" value="0" max="43"></progress>
							</div>

							<div class="space-y-5 text-sm">
								<div>
									<h3 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">Before the Procedure</h3>
									<div class="space-y-2">
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Prepared medication for only one patient at a time.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Used aseptic technique. Avoided distractions and interruptions.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Checked the medication label twice against the order in the MAR. Verified the expiration date.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Gathered the necessary equipment and supplies.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Took the medication to the patient at the correct time following the six rights of medication safety. Gave time-critical medications at the exact time specified.</span></label>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div>
									<h3 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">At the Bedside</h3>
									<div class="space-y-2">
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Provided for the patient's privacy.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Performed hand hygiene.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Introduced self to the patient and family.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Identified the patient using two identifiers per agency policy. Compared to the MAR or medical record.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Asked the patient about allergies.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>At the bedside, again compared the MAR with the medication labels and the patient's name (third check).</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Explained the procedure and ensured patient agreed to treatment. Discussed purpose, action, and possible adverse effects. Allowed questions. Informed patient the injection may cause slight stinging or burning.</span></label>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div>
									<h3 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">Site Selection and Preparation</h3>
									<div class="space-y-2">
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Selected an appropriate injection site. Assessed muscle integrity and size. Palpated for tenderness or hardness; avoided such areas. Rotated site if patient receives frequent injections.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Inspected for bruising, inflammation, or edema. Used a different site if present.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Helped patient into a comfortable position per the site selected. Exposed only the needed area.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Applied clean gloves. Used anatomical landmarks to locate site. Avoided the dorsogluteal site due to proximity to the sciatic nerve.</span></label>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div>
									<h3 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">Ventrogluteal Landmarking</h3>
									<div class="space-y-2">
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Placed the heel of the hand over the greater trochanter with the wrist nearly perpendicular to the femur.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Pointed thumb toward the patient's groin.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Pointed index finger to the anterior superior iliac spine.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Extended middle finger back along the iliac crest toward the buttocks.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Located injection site at the center of the triangle. Marked the site with an unopened alcohol wipe.</span></label>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div>
									<h3 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">Cleansing and Setup</h3>
									<div class="space-y-2">
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Cleansed the site with an antiseptic swab.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Held a gauze pad between the third and fourth fingers of the nondominant hand.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Removed the needle cap or protective sheath.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Held the syringe between the thumb and forefinger of the dominant hand.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Reminded patient to relax.</span></label>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div>
									<h3 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">Injection (Z-Track Technique)</h3>
									<div class="space-y-2">
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Pulled skin laterally 2.5–3.5 cm with the ulnar side of nondominant hand just below the site. Held position until needle inserted.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>If little muscle mass: grasped body of muscle between thumb and forefinger.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Inserted needle quickly into the muscle at a 90° angle using a steady, smooth motion.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Continued pulling skin taut. Stabilized syringe by grasping the lower barrel with nondominant hand resting on patient.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>If aspiration was performed and blood appeared: removed needle, discarded medication, obtained new syringe, tried again.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Injected the medication.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Waited 10 seconds, then quickly and smoothly withdrew the needle. Engaged safety sheath. Released skin. Applied dry cotton ball or gauze with light pressure for several seconds.</span></label>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div>
									<h3 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">After Injection</h3>
									<div class="space-y-2">
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Applied gentle pressure. Did <strong>not</strong> massage the site. Applied bandage if needed.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Discarded needle and syringe in a puncture-proof, leak-proof container.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Helped patient into a comfortable position. Disposed of used gauze. Removed gloves and performed hand hygiene.</span></label>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div>
									<h3 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">Documentation and Follow-Up</h3>
									<div class="space-y-2">
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Documented the injection immediately in the MAR: medication name, dosage, and injection site.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Stayed with patient for several minutes, observing for allergic reaction.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Placed toiletries and personal items within reach.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Placed call light within easy reach and ensured patient knew how to use it.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Raised appropriate side rails and lowered bed to lowest position.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Left the patient's room tidy.</span></label>
										<label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm mt-0.5 cl-item" /><span>Returned to patient's room in 15–30 minutes to assess for acute reaction at the injection site.</span></label>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

						</div>

						<!-- Tab 3: Transcript -->
						<input type="radio" name="page_tabs" role="tab" class="tab font-semibold" aria-label="Transcript" />
						<div role="tabpanel" class="tab-content p-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
							<p><strong>Before the procedure:</strong> When administering an intramuscular injection, prepare medication for only one patient at a time. Perform hand hygiene, use aseptic technique, avoid interruptions, and check the medication label against the order and MAR at least twice before bedside verification. Confirm expiration date and administer at the correct scheduled time, with stat doses immediately and now doses within 60 minutes.</p>
							<p><strong>At the bedside:</strong> Ensure privacy, identify the patient with two identifiers, verify allergies, and compare medication labels to the MAR again (third check). Explain the procedure, purpose, effects, and possible adverse reactions. Allow questions, obtain agreement, and inform the patient that mild stinging or burning may occur.</p>
							<p><strong>Site selection and preparation:</strong> Perform hand hygiene and don clean gloves. Preferred IM site is ventrogluteal (with vastus lateralis and deltoid as alternatives). Assess muscle integrity and rotate sites as needed. Avoid bruised, inflamed, edematous, hardened, or tender areas. Position the patient comfortably and expose only the needed area.</p>
							<p><strong>Landmarking and cleansing:</strong> For ventrogluteal landmarking, place the heel of the hand over the greater trochanter, point thumb toward groin, index finger to anterior superior iliac spine, and middle finger along iliac crest to form a V. Inject in the center of the triangle. Clean from center outward at least 5 cm (2 in). Optional comfort measures include EMLA (about 1 hour before) or vapocoolant spray just before injection.</p>
							<p><strong>Injection technique:</strong> Remove the cap, hold syringe like a dart, and use the Z-track method by pulling skin laterally 2.5-3.5 cm (1-1.5 in). Insert needle at a 90 degree angle with a smooth motion. Stabilize syringe. Aspirate unless giving a vaccine; if blood appears, discard and restart with new medication/syringe. If no blood appears, inject medication, wait 10 seconds, withdraw smoothly, activate safety sheath, release skin, and apply light pressure with gauze or alcohol swab.</p>
							<p><strong>After injection:</strong> Discard sharps in a puncture-proof, leak-proof container. Do not massage the site. Apply bandage if needed. Reposition patient comfortably, discard used supplies, remove gloves, and perform hand hygiene.</p>
							<p><strong>Documentation and follow-up:</strong> Document immediately in the MAR (medication, dose, and site). Observe the patient for several minutes for allergic reaction, then reassess in 15-20 minutes for acute site reactions such as burning, tingling, numbness, or pain.</p>
						</div>

					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<script>
				const items = document.querySelectorAll('.cl-item');
				const bar = document.getElementById('checklist-bar') as HTMLProgressElement;
				const count = document.getElementById('checklist-count');
				const total = items.length;

				function updateProgress() {
					const checked = document.querySelectorAll('.cl-item:checked').length;
					bar.value = checked;
					count.textContent = `${checked} of ${total} completed`;
				}

				items.forEach(cb => cb.addEventListener('change', updateProgress));
				updateProgress();

				(window as any).resetChecklist = () => {
					items.forEach((cb: any) => { cb.checked = false; });
					updateProgress();
				};
			</script>

			<SkillResourceModal />
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
